"Andrzej is a Polish teen selectee, trader ID B22, at Artonan Consulate 1 in Poland."
"He is short and pudgy, with dark blonde hair, narrow brown eyes and a friendly smile."
"He was chosen as a B-rank Chainer about a week before he traded."
"He wanted a Meister with a strength and stamina bonus and traded Chainer for Meister of Cudgel."
"His uncle is a Meister of Knuckles working in Warsaw."
"He plans to join a hero team mentorship program by pumping his physical stats."
"He dislikes wordchains, hasn't studied Artonan, and is learning English and Spanish."
"He called Alden Thorn a bad salesman and warned him to research Chainer's history."
"His family planned a party for his affixation."
"By autumn he is a Cudgel Meister in the CNH hero program, with a bulbous cudgel."
"His superhero uncle seems anti-Velra, and Andrzej feared the Velras had harmed Alden."
"He invited Alden to The B List, the club for B-rank hero students."
"His real goal skill is Throughblow, which his Knuckle Meister uncle also has."
"He sits in the B-rank section of Engaging with the Unexpected with Alden."
